---
import { ArrowDownRight, ArrowUpRight, Play } from "lucide-react";
import { ContactPreview } from "../components/ContactPreview";
import { EditorialMotion } from "../components/EditorialMotion";
import { InstagramCarousel } from "../components/InstagramCarousel";
import { WorkSwitcher } from "../components/WorkSwitcher";
import { feedSamples, pendingLinks, workSamples } from "../content";
import "@fontsource/montserrat/500.css";
import "@fontsource/montserrat/700.css";
import "@fontsource/montserrat/900.css";
import "../styles/site.css";

const bookingUrl = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_BOOKING_URL || "http://127.0.0.1:3000";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
    <meta name="description" content="Local concept preview for Didde-Mie Lykke From, also known as DD. Portfolio content and imagery are placeholders." />
    <title>Didde-Mie Lykke From / DD — concept preview</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <EditorialMotion client:load />
    <div class="preview-banner">CONCEPT PREVIEW <span>·</span> CONTENT, IMAGES AND CREDITS AWAIT DD</div>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="wordmark" href="#top" aria-label="DD — top of page">DD<span>.</span><small>DIDDE-MIE LYKKE FROM</small></a>
      <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#media">Media</a><a href="#social">Instagram</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav>
      <a class="header-book" href={bookingUrl}>STUDIO BOOKING <ArrowUpRight size={18} /></a>
      <details class="mobile-menu"><summary>MENU <span>+</span></summary><nav aria-label="Mobile navigation"><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#media">Media</a><a href="#social">Instagram</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a><a href={bookingUrl}>Studio booking</a></nav></details>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
        <div class="hero-topline"><span>DANCER / MOVEMENT ARTIST</span><span>DD / CONCEPT PREVIEW</span></div>
        <div class="hero-name"><h1 id="hero-heading"><span>DIDDE-MIE</span><span>LYKKE FROM</span><span>IN MOTION.</span></h1></div>
        <div class="hero-image" data-reveal>
          <img src="/concepts/dance-hero.png" alt="Illustrative anonymous street dancer in motion; not a photograph of DD" />
          <div class="hero-overlay-type" aria-hidden="true">DD.</div>
          <div class="hero-image-caption"><span>THE BODY SPEAKS FIRST.</span><span>ILLUSTRATIVE IMAGE / DD MEDIA PENDING</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-bottom"><span>PERSONAL SITE CONCEPT / 2026</span><a href="#work">SCROLL TO EXPLORE <ArrowDownRight size={21} /></a></div>
      </section>

      <section class="intro-statement" aria-label="Introduction">
        <div class="section-index"><span>01 / INTRODUCTION</span><span>WORDS IN PROGRESS</span></div>
        <p>AN OPEN STAGE<br />FOR WHAT COMES <em>NEXT.</em></p>
        <div class="intro-detail"><span>DD / DIDDE-MIE LYKKE FROM</span><p>DD's introduction, artistic point of view and verified credits will be written with her. This preview establishes the visual rhythm of the personal site.</p></div>
      </section>

      <div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true"><div>MOVE WITH INTENTION <span>✳</span> MAKE SPACE <span>✳</span> MOVE WITH INTENTION <span>✳</span> MAKE SPACE <span>✳</span> MOVE WITH INTENTION <span>✳</span> MAKE SPACE <span>✳</span></div></div>

      <section class="work-section" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
        <div class="section-index"><span>02 / SELECTED WORK</span><span>ACTS AND PROJECTS TO BE CONFIRMED</span></div>
        <div class="mega-heading"><h2 id="work-title">SELECTED<br /><span>WORK.</span></h2><p>Move over a project title to explore the image. Actual project names, roles, collaborators and photography will be added after DD's review.</p></div>
        <WorkSwitcher client:load items={workSamples} />
      </section>

      <section class="media-section" id="media" aria-labelledby="media-title">
        <div class="section-index"><span>03 / IN MOTION</span><span>SHOWREEL AND STILLS PENDING</span></div>
        <div class="mega-heading"><h2 id="media-title">THE MOVING<br /><span>IMAGE.</span></h2><p>A showreel, performance clips and credited stills belong here. This first version uses concept imagery until the approved media is supplied.</p></div>
        <div class="media-stage" data-reveal>
          <img src="/concepts/dance-study.png" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrative anonymous street dancer on a dark stage; not DD or an actual performance" />
          <div class="media-stage-type" aria-hidden="true">IN<br />MOTION</div>
          <div class="media-stage-label"><span><Play size={16} /> VIDEO SLOT</span><span>APPROVED SHOWREEL PENDING</span></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="social-section" id="social" aria-labelledby="social-title">
        <div class="section-index"><span>04 / INSTAGRAM</span><span>ACCOUNT CONNECTION IS A LATER STEP</span></div>
        <div class="mega-heading"><h2 id="social-title">AFTER THE<br /><span>STAGE.</span></h2><p>This carousel previews the feed layout. DD's posts will populate it after she authorizes the account and the connection is built.</p></div>
        <InstagramCarousel client:visible posts={feedSamples} />
      </section>

      <section class="links-section" aria-labelledby="links-title">
        <div class="section-index"><span>05 / FIND DD</span><span>DESTINATIONS PENDING CONFIRMATION</span></div>
        <div class="links-layout"><h2 id="links-title">ALL THE<br />WAYS TO <span>CONNECT.</span></h2><div class="links-list"><a href={bookingUrl}><span>Studio booking</span><small>LOCAL PREVIEW</small><ArrowUpRight size={23} /></a>{pendingLinks.map((label) => <div class="pending-link"><span>{label}</span><small>LINK PENDING</small><ArrowUpRight size={23} /></div>)}</div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact-section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <div class="section-index"><span>06 / GET IN TOUCH</span><span>DELIVERY IS NOT CONNECTED</span></div>
        <div class="contact-layout"><div class="contact-copy"><h2 id="contact-title">LET'S<br />MOVE<br /><span>TOGETHER.</span></h2><p>The final contact address and message delivery are pending. The form checks fields locally and sends nothing.</p></div><ContactPreview client:load /></div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-top"><a href="#top" aria-label="Return to top">DD.</a><div><span>DIDDE-MIE LYKKE FROM</span><p>Dancer / movement artist<br />Personal site concept preview</p></div><a href={bookingUrl}>STUDIO BOOKING <ArrowUpRight size={20} /></a></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} DD</span><span>ILLUSTRATIVE IMAGES · NOT DD OR HER STUDIO</span><span>CONTACT & SOCIAL LINKS PENDING</span></div></footer>
  </body>
</html>
